{"id":"n5_u08_l1","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Verbs I: eat, drink, watch, listen, read, write","goal":"Learn the polite form (～ます) of six everyday verbs.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_tabemasu","v_nomimasu","v_mimasu","v_kikimasu","v_yomimasu","v_kakimasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"The polite ます form","body":["Verbs in the polite present end in ます: たべます (eat), のみます (drink), みます (watch), ききます (listen), よみます (read), かきます (write). The same form is used for habits and the near future."],"examples":[{"ja":"おちゃ を のみます","reading":"ocha o nomimasu","en":"I drink tea."},{"ja":"ほん を よみます","reading":"hon o yomimasu","en":"I read a book."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_vb01","q_n5u08_vb02","q_n5u08_vb03","q_n5u08_vb04","q_n5u08_vb05","q_n5u08_vb06","q_n5u08_vmt01","q_n5u08_ty01","q_n5u08_ty02","q_n5u08_ty03","q_n5u08_dc01","q_n5u08_gl01","q_n5u08_gl02"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_vb01","q_n5u08_vb03","q_n5u08_vb05","q_n5u08_vb06","q_n5u08_vmt01","q_n5u08_ty01","q_n5u08_gl01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l2","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Verbs II: go, come, buy, speak, sleep, wait","goal":"Add ten more polite verbs.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_ikimasu","v_kimasu","v_kaerimasu","v_kaimasu","v_hanashimasu","v_shimasu","v_nemasu","v_okimasu","v_aimasu","v_machimasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Movement and daily routine","body":["いきます (go), きます (come), かえります (go home), かいます (buy), はなします (speak), します (do), ねます (sleep), おきます (get up), あいます (meet), まちます (wait)."],"examples":[{"ja":"あさ ろくじ に おきます","reading":"asa rokuji ni okimasu","en":"I get up at six in the morning."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_vb07","q_n5u08_vb08","q_n5u08_vb09","q_n5u08_vb10","q_n5u08_vb11","q_n5u08_vb12","q_n5u08_vb13","q_n5u08_vb14","q_n5u08_vb15","q_n5u08_vb16","q_n5u08_vmt02","q_n5u08_ty04","q_n5u08_ty05","q_n5u08_ty06","q_n5u08_ty07","q_n5u08_dc04","q_n5u08_gl03","q_n5u08_gl04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_vb07","q_n5u08_vb09","q_n5u08_vb12","q_n5u08_vb14","q_n5u08_vmt02","q_n5u08_ty04","q_n5u08_gl03","q_n5u08_dc04"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l3","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Things to eat, do and enjoy","goal":"Learn the nouns you pair with the verbs.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_soba","v_udon","v_dango","v_senbei","v_taiyaki","v_ongaku","v_shigoto","v_benkyou","v_kaimono"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Objects of the verbs","body":["Food: そば, うどん, だんご, せんべい, たいやき. Activities: おんがく (music), しごと (work), べんきょう (study), かいもの (shopping)."],"examples":[{"ja":"うどん を たべます","reading":"udon o tabemasu","en":"I eat udon."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_tr02","q_n5u08_tr03","q_n5u08_vm_soba","q_n5u08_vm_udon","q_n5u08_vm_dango","q_n5u08_vm_senbei","q_n5u08_vm_taiyaki","q_n5u08_vm_ongaku","q_n5u08_vm_shigoto","q_n5u08_vm_benkyou","q_n5u08_vm_kaimono"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_tr02","q_n5u08_tr03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l4","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Time words and ます / ません","goal":"Say when you do things and negate a verb.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_mainichi","v_hiru","v_ban","v_ashita","v_itsu"],"grammar":["g_masu_forms"]},"explain":[{"heading":"ます and ません","body":["A polite verb is negated with ません: のみます → のみません. Add か for a question: のみます か. Answer with はい / いいえ.","Time words: まいにち (every day), あした (tomorrow), ひる (noon), ばん (evening) and いつ (when). With a clock time use に: ろくじ に おきます. With まいにち and あした no に is needed."],"examples":[{"ja":"テレビ は みません","reading":"terebi wa mimasen","en":"I do not watch TV."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gm01","q_n5u08_gm02","q_n5u08_gm03","q_n5u08_gm04","q_n5u08_gm05","q_n5u08_ty08","q_n5u08_ty09","q_n5u08_tr01","q_n5u08_tr04","q_n5u08_tr05","q_n5u08_dc02","q_n5u08_dc03","q_n5u08_vm_mainichi","q_n5u08_vm_hiru","q_n5u08_vm_ban","q_n5u08_vm_ashita","q_n5u08_vm_itsu"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gm06","q_n5u08_tr09","q_n5u08_tr11"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gm01","q_n5u08_gm02","q_n5u08_gm03","q_n5u08_gm04","q_n5u08_gm05","q_n5u08_tr04"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l5","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"を: the object","goal":"Say what you eat, read and buy.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_wo_object"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Object を verb","body":["を marks the thing the verb acts on: ごはん を たべます. Read it \"o\". The same pattern works with ください: そば を ください."],"examples":[{"ja":"てがみ を かきます","reading":"tegami o kakimasu","en":"I write a letter."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gw01","q_n5u08_gw02","q_n5u08_gw03","q_n5u08_gw04","q_n5u08_gw05","q_n5u08_gw06","q_n5u08_gw07","q_n5u08_so03","q_n5u08_tr06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gw01","q_n5u08_gw02","q_n5u08_gw03","q_n5u08_gw04","q_n5u08_gw06","q_n5u08_so03","q_n5u08_tr06"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l6","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"で and へ: places and means","goal":"Say where you do things, how you go, and where to.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_aruite","v_hikouki","v_jitensha"],"grammar":["g_de_place_means","g_he_direction"]},"explain":[{"heading":"で: where and how","body":["で marks the place of an action (スーパー で かいます) and the means (バス で いきます)."],"examples":[{"ja":"バス で いきます","reading":"basu de ikimasu","en":"I go by bus."}]},{"heading":"へ: toward a place","body":["へ marks the destination and is pronounced \"e\": がっこう へ いきます. Ask どこ へ いきます か."],"examples":[{"ja":"どこ へ いきます か","reading":"doko e ikimasu ka","en":"Where will you go?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gd01","q_n5u08_gd02","q_n5u08_gd03","q_n5u08_gd04","q_n5u08_gd05","q_n5u08_gd06","q_n5u08_gh01","q_n5u08_gh02","q_n5u08_gh03","q_n5u08_gh04","q_n5u08_gh05","q_n5u08_gh06","q_n5u08_so01","q_n5u08_so02","q_n5u08_tr07","q_n5u08_tr12","q_n5u08_vm_aruite","q_n5u08_vm_hikouki","q_n5u08_vm_jitensha"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gd01","q_n5u08_gd02","q_n5u08_gd03","q_n5u08_gh01","q_n5u08_gh02","q_n5u08_gh04","q_n5u08_so01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l7","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Kanji for actions","goal":"Read ten action kanji.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_shoku","k_in","k_mi","k_gyou","k_rai","k_doku","k_sho","k_wa","k_bai","k_bun"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Verb kanji","body":["Most verb kanji carry the start of the verb and the ending stays in kana: 食べます, 飲みます, 見ます, 行きます, 来ます, 読みます, 書きます, 話します, 買います, 聞きます.","Compare 見 (see) with 聞 (hear) and 読 (read) with 書 (write); they look alike."],"examples":[{"ja":"食べます","reading":"tabemasu","en":"eat"},{"ja":"行きます","reading":"ikimasu","en":"go"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_kd01","q_n5u08_kd02","q_n5u08_kd03","q_n5u08_kd04","q_n5u08_kd05","q_n5u08_kd06","q_n5u08_kd07","q_n5u08_kd08","q_n5u08_kd09","q_n5u08_kd10","q_n5u08_kk01","q_n5u08_kk02","q_n5u08_kk03","q_n5u08_kk04","q_n5u08_kk05","q_n5u08_kk06","q_n5u08_kk07","q_n5u08_kk08","q_n5u08_kk09","q_n5u08_kk10","q_n5u08_kmt01","q_n5u08_kmt02","q_n5u08_kcf01","q_n5u08_kcf02","q_n5u08_kcf03"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_kd01","q_n5u08_kd04","q_n5u08_kd06","q_n5u08_kd10","q_n5u08_kk01","q_n5u08_kk04","q_n5u08_kk06","q_n5u08_kmt01","q_n5u08_kcf01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l8","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"A walk in the temple town","goal":"Handle a visit to a temple and snack stalls.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_otera","v_omairi","v_omikuji","v_menyuu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"At the temple and the stall","body":["おてら (temple), おまいり (praying), おみくじ (fortune slip), メニュー. Ask for things with を ください."],"examples":[{"ja":"メニュー を ください","reading":"menyuu o kudasai","en":"The menu, please."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_dg01","q_n5u08_dg02","q_n5u08_dg03","q_n5u08_dg04","q_n5u08_dg05","q_n5u08_dg06","q_n5u08_dg07","q_n5u08_tr08","q_n5u08_tr10","q_n5u08_vm_otera","q_n5u08_vm_omairi","q_n5u08_vm_omikuji","q_n5u08_vm_menyuu"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_dg01","q_n5u08_dg03","q_n5u08_dg04","q_n5u08_dg05","q_n5u08_dg06"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u08_l9","unit_id":"n5_u08","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Listen and read","goal":"Follow short routines by ear and read a menu and notes.","introduces":{},"explain":[{"heading":"Short routines","body":["Listen for the verb ending: ます or ません."],"examples":[{"ja":"テレビ は みません","reading":"terebi wa mimasen","en":"I do not watch TV."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gl05","q_n5u08_gl06","q_n5u08_gl07","q_n5u08_gl08"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_rq01","q_n5u08_rq02","q_n5u08_rq03","q_n5u08_rq04","q_n5u08_rq05","q_n5u08_rq06","q_n5u08_rq07","q_n5u08_rq08","q_n5u08_rq09","q_n5u08_rq10"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u08_gl05","q_n5u08_gl06","q_n5u08_gl07","q_n5u08_rq01","q_n5u08_rq05","q_n5u08_rq08"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
